{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1110806001:0":{"text":"저거 보세요! 이곳의 트라이브가 바리케이드로 길을 막고 있어요. 이러면 지나갈 수 없다고요!","source_cn":"你们看！这里的蛮血用拒马把路拦住了，这样就过不去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x868146DB88CFBE6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110806002:0":{"text":"하나밖에 없는 멀쩡한 길을 왜 막아 놓은 걸까요?","source_cn":"好端端的，为什么要把唯一的道路封住呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA55A0019B4E7C3A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110806003:0":{"text":"멈춰! 뭘 하러 온 거지? 보물찾기? 아니면 장사?","source_cn":"留步！你们来做什么？寻宝？还是经商？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DDE93720B30509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110806004:0":{"text":"... 사람을 찾으러.","source_cn":"……找人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45EC2740D5C8D369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110806005:0":{"text":"사람을 찾아? 너희 부족에도 실종자가 있나?","source_cn":"找人？你们的族人也失踪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD84C0E45DE1FA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title